# AI Browser Agents and Anti-Detect Browsers

An anti-detect browser generally focuses on browser-profile and fingerprint management.

A proxy focuses primarily on network routing.

These capabilities can complement one another.

```text
AI Agent
    ↓
Automation Layer
    ↓
Anti-Detect Browser
    ├── Profile
    ├── Fingerprint
    └── Session
          ↓
       Proxy
          ↓
       Website
```

The anti-detect browser manages the browser environment.

The proxy manages the network path.

The AI agent manages the workflow.

